{"seq":9,"id":"TM4","type":"term","at":"2026-11-14T19:51:08Z","by":"AC1","prev":"sha256:85b7848aeb3cad09acc416f297abf784f499dd9d33dbf5c46e30c3c580c95c95","content_hash":"sha256:53ffd16dc37cff8576eb2235dfe142b5210a02a70d39d5679a0e2c4e2dbcf068","supersedes":null,"origin":null,"body":{"term":"sMAPE","kind":"variable","definition":"Symmetric mean absolute percentage error, in the form of the M3 and M4 competitions: 200 * mean(|y - f| / (|y| + |f|)); a pair with y = f = 0 is left out and counted.","source":"doi:10.1016/j.ijforecast.2006.03.001"}}
